<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001C_S000C" variety="S000C">
<name>Audio &amp; Visual</name>
<ttl id="1001C_S000C_742AF_T002Q" variety="T002Q">
<name>Speaker Assembly Rear</name>
<para id="RM000002BZV001X" category="A" type-id="80001" name-id="641JY-00" from="200612">
<name>Removal</name>
<subpara id="RM000002BZV001X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000002BZV001X_01_0013" proc-id="RM0550J___00009T000000">
<ptxt>Remove Rear Door Inside Handle Bezel RH
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using a screwdriver with its tip wrapped in protective tape, disengage the 3 claws and remove the rear door inside handle bezel RH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153652J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000002BZV001X_01_0014" proc-id="RM0550J___00009T100000">
<ptxt>Remove Door Assist Grip Cover RH
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using a screwdriver with its tip wrapped in protective tape, disengage the 4 claws and remove the door assist grip cover RH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153654J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000002BZV001X_01_0015" proc-id="RM0550J___00009T200000">
<ptxt>Remove Rear Door Trim Board Sub-assembly RH
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the 3 screws.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B157313" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using a clip remover, disengage the 9 clips.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153656" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disengage the 3 claws and disconnect the rear door trim board RH from the rear door glass weatherstrip inner RH.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disengage the 2 claws and remove the rear door trim board RH from the rear door inside handle RH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153657" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000002BZV001X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000018Y00000">
<ptxt>Remove Speaker Assembly Rear</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E137091" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the 3 rivets and remove the speaker assembly RR from the rear door.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>